guide forever/professions/lockpicking
title Lockpicking 1-300
category Professions
class Rogue
coords era
levels 16-60
zone Azeroth

# Lockpicking is a Rogue skill: Pick Lock opens locked boxes, chests and doors, and every lock that is
# not too easy for you raises the skill. The skill can never go past five times your level (100 at
# level 20, 150 at 30, 225 at 45, 300 at 60), so the guide asks for those levels as it goes.
#
# Pick Lock comes from your class trainer at level 16 and needs Thieves' Tools in your bags. Boxes
# that mobs drop or that you pickpocket raise the skill too, but the boxes here come back fast.
#

section Lockpicking 1-100

step Reach level 16
  tip Pick Lock needs level 16.
  level 16

step Learn Pick Lock
  tip Any Rogue trainer teaches it; it starts Lockpicking.
  when !knows 1804
  train class

step Buy Thieves' Tools
  tip A tool: Pick Lock does not work without it in your bags.
  buy 5060 x1 nearest

step Pick the boxes until 80
  tip They come back within seconds. The Jewel of the Southsea in the ship's hold spawns a deadly mob when opened.
  goto 65.0,45.4 "Buccaneer's Strongboxes" map 1413 only Horde r 30
  goto 52.0,45.2 "Practice Lockboxes" map 1433 only Alliance r 30
  skill Lockpicking 80 nearest

step Reach level 20
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 100 needs level 20.
  level 20

step Pick the boxes until 100
  goto 65.0,45.4 "Buccaneer's Strongboxes" map 1413 only Horde r 30
  goto 52.0,45.2 "Practice Lockboxes" map 1433 only Alliance r 30
  skill Lockpicking 100 nearest

section Lockpicking 100-150

step Reach level 30
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 150 needs level 30.
  level 30

step Pick the Waterlogged Footlockers until 150
  tip On the shore of Zoram Strand; from 110 the ones in the water work too.
  goto 13.0,23.8 "Zoram Strand footlockers" map 1440 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 150

section Lockpicking 150-225

step Reach level 45
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 225 needs level 45.
  level 45

step Pick the footlockers of Angor Fortress until 225
  tip Battered Footlockers upstairs; from 175 the Dented ones downstairs, a point every time up to 215.
  goto 41.5,28.1 "Angor Fortress" map 1418 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 225

section Lockpicking 225-300

step Reach level 60
  tip Lockpicking stops at 5 times your level: 300 needs level 60.
  level 60

step Pick the Dented Footlockers until 300
  tip Points all the way to 300; past 290 a point comes less often. Lost Rigger Cove has the same boxes.
  goto 45.3,32.0 "The Slag Pit, upper level" map 1427 r 30
  goto 73.5,46.6 "Lost Rigger Cove" map 1446 r 30
  skill Lockpicking 300 nearest
